<mxCell id="S1-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Confirm the request&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Restate the request and wait for approval before starting.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Request from the owner&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Session start: the board is loaded (rules, facts, next task)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Restate the request; start on the owner's approval&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Design choices come from research and measurements, not from questions to the owner&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="144" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S1-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Check existing knowledge&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Search memory before starting new work.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Memory lookup: solved or decided before?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Check token usage and agree a cap before starting helpers&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#7c3aed;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;uses B2 Problem lookup · B3 Library · B5 Standing notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="465" width="400" height="238" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S1-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Split into units&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;A unit is one job for one session, small enough for one context window.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Split the work into units&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Each unit declares: files it writes and reads, dependencies, shared resources, risk, model, size&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="749" width="400" height="311" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S1-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Order the units&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Find which units can run in parallel and estimate the finish time.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Two graphs: dependencies, and collisions (units that write the same place)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Waves: units with no open dependency and no collision start together&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Estimated finish time and the limiting resource&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Plan file: role, model, token limit and order, read by the plan gate&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="1106" width="400" height="276" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S2" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;2&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;ADMIT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Decide which units start now, and on which model.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=132;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#e4edff;swimlaneFillColor=#e4edff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="649.6" y="1291" width="452" height="1449.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S2-foot" value="Open: how to measure the value of a unit." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="S2"><mxGeometry x="26" y="1396" width="400" height="45.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S2-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Readiness and fit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Only units whose dependencies are done and that fit every limit.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ready queue: units whose dependencies are all done&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fit filter: a unit must fit every limit at once&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#b45309;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;uses D Limits&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S2"><mxGeometry x="26" y="144" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S2-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Next unit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Order among the ready units.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;In a tight token window: most value per token&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Otherwise oldest first, with short units filling gaps&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Reservation: a slot and tokens held for the oldest unit that does not fit yet&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S2"><mxGeometry x="26" y="465" width="400" height="238" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S2-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Model choice&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;The smallest model that gives the same output.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Haiku: locate things, extract into a fixed form&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Sonnet: read, collect, run commands, build ordinary code&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Opus: delicate code, analysis, refuting, coordinating&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fable: coordinating a tree that has sub-trees&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Raise the effort level before moving to a larger model&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#7c3aed;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;see B4 Reasoning cache&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S2"><mxGeometry x="26" y="749" width="400" height="311" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S2-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Gate and start&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;A script allows the start; the unit gets its own workspace.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Plan gate: refuses a start the plan does not allow&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Start: own copy of the repository, own branch, a one-page brief&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S2"><mxGeometry x="26" y="1106" width="400" height="276" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S3" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;3&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;WORK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Units run as a tree of sessions, one purpose per session.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=132;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#e4edff;swimlaneFillColor=#e4edff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1219.2" y="1291" width="452" height="1449.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S3-foot" value="Open: whether to split or hand over when work grows; when an extra coordination level is worth it." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="S3"><mxGeometry x="26" y="1396" width="400" height="45.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S3-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Session tree&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Coordinators assign and track work; workers do it.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Root session: coordinates only; keeps the task table&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Inner session: coordinates one part, where its summary is much shorter than the work&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Worker session: one unit, in its own copy (a worktree)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Helpers: short-lived, one lookup or one check; not a level of the tree&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S3"><mxGeometry x="26" y="144" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S3-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Hand-off format&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;How sessions pass work without re-reading each other's context.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Brief: one page with scope, file pointers, settled points, open items, done condition&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fixed return format, checked by script&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S3"><mxGeometry x="26" y="465" width="400" height="238" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S3-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Worker steps&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Look up, claim the files, write.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Query the code map and memory before opening files&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Claim: declare what will be written, down to the function&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Version-checked write: only if the place is unchanged since it was read&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#15803d;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;uses A3 Code queries · B2 Problem lookup&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S3"><mxGeometry x="26" y="749" width="400" height="311" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S3-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Report&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Results stay on disk; the parent reads a summary.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Results on disk: only path, hash and a short summary are passed up&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Claims file: every claim with the test that proves it&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;quot;Done&amp;quot; is written last; the parent wakes, re-reads state, starts the next unit&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S3"><mxGeometry x="26" y="1106" width="400" height="276" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S4" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;4&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;CHECK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Test and review every change before it is merged.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=132;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#e4edff;swimlaneFillColor=#e4edff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1788.8" y="1291" width="452" height="1449.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S4-foot" value="Open: who runs the gate where hooks cannot; how to handle tests that fail at random." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="S4"><mxGeometry x="26" y="1396" width="400" height="45.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S4-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Unit tests&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;While it works, a unit runs only its own tests.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Own tests first&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Full suite before work is stacked on unchecked parts, and once at the end&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S4"><mxGeometry x="26" y="144" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S4-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Shared test suite&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;The full suite has few slots, so runs are queued and shortened.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Visible, ordered queue; runs in a clean container&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Test selection: only the tests the change can affect&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Batch waiting changes; split the batch only if it fails&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Speculative testing: assume the change ahead passes&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S4"><mxGeometry x="26" y="465" width="400" height="238" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S4-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Independent review&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;A new session looks for faults in the result.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Reviewer sees only the result&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Coverage rule: every item is returned, run again, or waived in writing&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Planted faults: measure how many each check catches&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S4"><mxGeometry x="26" y="749" width="400" height="311" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S4-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Verdict&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;A recorded result for one exact commit.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Typed verdict: pass, fail or not run, naming the commit&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;A finding closes only on a test that fails before the fix and passes after&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fix rounds: two at most; revert, do not patch; a new reviewer after two failures&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S4"><mxGeometry x="26" y="1106" width="400" height="276" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S5" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;5&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;LAND&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Merge checked changes one at a time, in order.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=132;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#e4edff;swimlaneFillColor=#e4edff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2358.4" y="1291" width="452" height="1449.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S5-foot" value="Open: wait or redo when two units change the same place; the literature gives no general answer." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="S5"><mxGeometry x="26" y="1396" width="400" height="45.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S5-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Merge queue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;One script and one lock decide the order.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Single order, single lock&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Only the exact commit that was reviewed is merged&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;A person reads high-risk lines (payments, access) before the merge&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S5"><mxGeometry x="26" y="144" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S5-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Merge and recheck&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;The merged result is tested; a failure is reverted.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;The suite runs on the merged result; on failure the merge is reverted&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Commit check: refuses a commit that edits records or evidence&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S5"><mxGeometry x="26" y="465" width="400" height="238" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S5-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Write conflicts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Methods, in the order tried, when changes collide.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;1. Separate copies (baseline)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;2. Restructure frequently changed places into entries applied at merge&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;3. Version-checked writes: re-read and redo if changed&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;4. Claims below file level: lock a function, not a file&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;5. Wait for a conflicting pair, if waiting costs less than redoing&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;6. Structured merge, last&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S5"><mxGeometry x="26" y="749" width="400" height="311" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S5-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;After the merge&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Records are updated from the merged state.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Board rebuilt from each unit's state file, never edited by hand&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#15803d;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds A1 Code map&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S5"><mxGeometry x="26" y="1106" width="400" height="276" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S6" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;6&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;LEARN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Record the measurements and findings of the task.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=132;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#e4edff;swimlaneFillColor=#e4edff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2928" y="1291" width="452" height="1449.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S6-foot" value="Open: who marks a stored entry stale when the code under it changes." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="S6"><mxGeometry x="26" y="1396" width="400" height="45.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S6-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Record measurements&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Actual figures update the next plan's estimates.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Actual footprint and duration of each unit&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Tokens per unit become the next plan's estimate&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Correct the rates: estimated against actual finish&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#be185d;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds D Limits · G Measurement&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S6"><mxGeometry x="26" y="144" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S6-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Store findings&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Solved problems and findings are added to memory.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;A solved hard problem is recorded in the knowledge store&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;A finding, ruling or mistake becomes a library record with its evidence&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#7c3aed;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds B1 Problem records · B3 Library&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S6"><mxGeometry x="26" y="465" width="400" height="238" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S6-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Convert to checks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;A repeated lesson becomes an automated test.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Rule of three: seen three times, it becomes a lint rule, a test or a gate clause&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Promoted check: a confirmed trap becomes a test in the shared suite&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S6"><mxGeometry x="26" y="749" width="400" height="311" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="S6-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b2a6f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Maintenance and hand-over&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Keep stored entries correct and worth their cost.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #1d4ed8;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Mark stale entries&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Record misses&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Count every lookup: hits, misses, false leads&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Stop rule: a store with fewer than 3 verified hits in 20 uses is retired&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Hand over through files, not through a session's memory&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1d4ed8;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="S6"><mxGeometry x="26" y="1106" width="400" height="276" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x7" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#f3f4f6;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="54" y="2842.5" width="3352" height="1677.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x8" value="CONTROLS" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=54;fontColor=#334155;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="2868.5" width="344.5" height="73.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="C" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#b91c1c;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;C&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#6b0f0f;&quot;&gt;GUARDS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Scripts that check a step before it runs and can refuse it.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#fde2e2;swimlaneFillColor=#fde2e2;strokeColor=#b91c1c;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="2962" width="3212" height="439.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="C-foot" value="Status: in use in this repository, except the write guard and the audit. Not tested: whether the hooks run inside helpers and in other folders." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="C"><mxGeometry x="26" y="405" width="3160" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="C-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6b0f0f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;At session start&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;The rules are loaded into the session.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #b91c1c;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Start hook: loads the board, also after a compaction&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b91c1c;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="C"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="C-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6b0f0f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Before a helper starts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Checks the model, and that the plan allows the start.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #b91c1c;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Tier hook: refuses the wrong model for the kind of job&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Plan gate: refuses a start the plan does not allow&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b91c1c;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="C"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="C-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6b0f0f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Before a write&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Protects records; keeps a unit within its own files.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #b91c1c;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Record guard: no edits to evidence or journal lines; no design questions to the owner&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Write guard: no write outside the files the unit declared&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b91c1c;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="C"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="C-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6b0f0f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Heavy commands&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Heavy commands are queued.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #b91c1c;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;The lane: a queue with a few slots, low priority, a time limit&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b91c1c;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="C"><mxGeometry x="1406" y="116" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="C-5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6b0f0f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;At commit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;The same rules, applied again at commit.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #b91c1c;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Commit check: also catches writes made through the shell&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b91c1c;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="C"><mxGeometry x="1866" y="116" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="C-6" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6b0f0f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;After the run&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Transcripts are checked against the rules.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #b91c1c;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Transcript audit: which model each helper ran on, and what it read&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b91c1c;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="C"><mxGeometry x="2326" y="116" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="C-7" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6b0f0f;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Foundations&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;What the guards depend on.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #b91c1c;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Least privilege: each role gets only its tools and folders&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Trusted checker: only a small script promotes a claim to a fact&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Sealed ledger: each line carries the hash of the line before&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Self-test and canary: a planted violation must be caught&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b91c1c;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="C"><mxGeometry x="2786" y="116" width="400" height="275" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="D" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#b45309;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;D&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#6b2f02;&quot;&gt;LIMITS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;The number of units that run at once is set by the tightest limit.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#ffecc9;swimlaneFillColor=#ffecc9;strokeColor=#b45309;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="3485.8" width="1372" height="547.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="D-foot" value="Status: a hypothesis from the literature; its numbers depend on measurements Q01 to Q37. Open: how re-read tokens count against the allowance." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="D"><mxGeometry x="26" y="513" width="1320" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="D-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6b2f02;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Measure each limit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;One number per limited resource.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #b45309;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Memory: a hard floor; below it nothing starts&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Processor: cores busy against cores present&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;The shared test suite: slots × (test time + work time) / test time&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ready work: more workers than ready units does not help&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Token windows: one refills every 5 hours, one every week; fit both&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;The parent's window: too many children overflow it&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b45309;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="D"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="383" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="D-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6b2f02;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Concurrency&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot; style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Run as many as the tightest limit allows, and record which limit it is.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b45309;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="D"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="383" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="D-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6b2f02;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Token pacing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Spend the allowance without running out.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #b45309;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Token governor: one budget per window; learns the window's size from limit messages&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Reserve: for running units, and for the owner's own use&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Spend the rest immediately while work is waiting&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;A unit's own cap: measured need plus a buffer; then save state and hand on&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;A more expensive model only where its value exceeds its share of the window&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#1d4ed8;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds 2 ADMIT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b45309;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="D"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="383" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="E" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#475569;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;E&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#1e293b;&quot;&gt;CONTEXT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Keep each session's context window small, since every call re-reads all of it.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#e2e8f0;swimlaneFillColor=#e2e8f0;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1548" y="3485.8" width="1832" height="547.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="E-foot" value="Status: measured over 7.35 billion tokens in two projects. The split rule is approved for one trial at 300,000 tokens; not run yet. Open: whether a brief loses less than a summary." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="E"><mxGeometry x="26" y="513" width="1780" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="E-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#1e293b;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Token usage&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Measured over 35,800 model calls.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #475569;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Re-reads are 96.8 % of all tokens: usage = calls × window size&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;A window holds: fixed prefix 27 %, own earlier output 26 %, fetched content 26 %, old summaries 8 %&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;The long-running coordinator uses the most: 333,000 to 396,000 tokens per call&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;65 % of a session's re-read tokens are past 300,000&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Minor factors: model mix, file reads, human prompts&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;After a compaction: mistakes rise from 0.58 to 1.35 per 100 calls, then fall back&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="E"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="383" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="E-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#1e293b;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Reducing window size&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Six methods.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #475569;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Cap the coordinator: hand over at 150,000 to 200,000 tokens&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Remove unused tool descriptions from helpers: about 60,000 tokens&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#94a3b8&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Batch lookups: one call for several reads&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#94a3b8&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Keep own output on disk, not in the window&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fewer parent wakes: children report in batches&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Scripts before agents&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="E"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="383" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="E-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#1e293b;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Monitoring and splitting&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;A session near its limit is split in two.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #475569;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fill gauge: a script reads the fill at every step&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;At 300,000 tokens: take nothing new, finish, commit&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Split by scope: two children, each with a brief&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Or roll over: one successor continues from files&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Brief confirmation: each child checks its brief against the repository&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Merge small siblings&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="E"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="383" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="E-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#1e293b;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fallbacks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;If the split does not happen in time.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #475569;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Tree caps: 3 children, 3 levels&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Hard ceiling: 10 points past the line, only the hand-over is written&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Compaction: the app summarises the window&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Kept tail: the last messages verbatim, beside the summary and the git status&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Hand-over check: a reader compares it with the real state&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Lowest-cost hand-over point: a square-root law&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#1d4ed8;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds 3 WORK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="E"><mxGeometry x="1406" y="116" width="400" height="383" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="F" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f766e;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;F&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#084742;&quot;&gt;RECOVERY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Work is kept and resumed when a session or the machine fails.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#d5f2ee;swimlaneFillColor=#d5f2ee;strokeColor=#0f766e;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="4117.5" width="2292" height="376.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="F-foot" value="Status: scripts built, 965 tests pass; never run on a real tree. 13 fixes designed, none built. Open: keeping the PC on while the owner is away." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="F"><mxGeometry x="26" y="342" width="2240" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="F-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#084742;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;State on disk&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;No important state is kept only inside a session.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #0f766e;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Task table: units, attempts, states&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Commit record: a result exists once its record is written; the first record wins&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Checkpoint: a session near its cap saves its state&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0f766e;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="F"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="212" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="F-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#084742;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Monitoring&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;A script outside the session checks progress, not only that it is running.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #0f766e;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Watcher: reads, decides, exits&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Stall: calls but no progress. Hang: no calls. Loop: the same call three times&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0f766e;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="F"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="212" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="F-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#084742;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Restart&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;One restart, from the last commit.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #0f766e;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Restart once; a second failure goes to the parent&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Attempt number and fence: output of an older attempt is refused&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Circuit breaker: two new failures in a row stop the wave&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0f766e;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="F"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="212" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="F-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#084742;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Resume&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;State is re-read from files.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #0f766e;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;A wake signal is only a hint; two wake sources back each other up&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Resume two at a time; a session that disagrees with its branch stays parked&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0f766e;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="F"><mxGeometry x="1406" y="116" width="400" height="212" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="F-5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#084742;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;External safeguards&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;For when the whole tree stops.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #0f766e;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Inactivity alert: fires if the whole tree stops&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Machine: off-site copy, restart chain, sensor log, no sleep while working&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#1d4ed8;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds 3 WORK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#0f766e;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="F"><mxGeometry x="1866" y="116" width="400" height="212" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x9" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;strokeWidth=2;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="44" width="3300" height="277" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x10" value="KEY" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=32;fontColor=#0f172a;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3550" y="66" width="84.5" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x11" value="The system map shows one box per pipeline." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3550" y="126" width="886" height="29.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x12" value="Each pipeline is drawn in full under the same code, as a row of steps joined by arrows." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3550" y="159.8" width="886" height="29.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x13" value="Each step has a one-line description and a list of its parts." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3550" y="193.5" width="886" height="29.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x14" value="The coloured line at the bottom of a step names the pipeline it feeds or uses." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3550" y="227.3" width="886" height="29.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x15" value="STATUS OF EACH PART" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;fontColor=#0f172a;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4530" y="126" width="257.1" height="29.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x16" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#16a34a;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4531" y="163.8" width="16" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x17" value="Built: exists and has run, or passed its tests." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4560" y="159.8" width="566" height="28.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x18" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#f59e0b;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4531" y="195.3" width="16" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x19" value="Designed: specified, not built." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4560" y="191.3" width="566" height="28.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x20" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#94a3b8;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4531" y="226.8" width="16" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x21" value="Idea: discussed, not designed." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4560" y="222.8" width="566" height="28.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x22" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#e11d48;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4531" y="258.3" width="16" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x23" value="Tested once, no gain: one form on one repository; not conclusive." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4560" y="254.3" width="566" height="28.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x24" value="TERMS" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;fontColor=#0f172a;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5230" y="126" width="87.3" height="29.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x25" value="Token: a piece of a word. Models read, write and are metered in tokens." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5230" y="159.8" width="746" height="27.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x26" value="Context window: everything the model reads on one call. It grows as a session goes on." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5230" y="188" width="746" height="27.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x27" value="Session: one run of a model with its own context window." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5230" y="216.3" width="746" height="27.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x28" value="Helper: a short-lived agent that a session starts for one job." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5230" y="244.5" width="746" height="27.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x29" value="Unit: one planned job for one session." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5230" y="272.8" width="746" height="27.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x30" value="Worktree: a separate copy of the repository on its own branch." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="6030" y="159.8" width="746" height="27.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x31" value="Hook: a script the app runs before a tool call. It can refuse the call." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="6030" y="188" width="746" height="27.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x32" value="Compaction: the app replaces a full window by a summary of it." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="6030" y="216.3" width="746" height="27.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x33" value="Shared test suite: the full suite a change must pass before it is merged." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="6030" y="244.5" width="746" height="27.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x34" value="Commit: one saved change in the history of the repository." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="6030" y="272.8" width="746" height="27.3" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x35" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#f3f4f6;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3494" y="397" width="3352" height="1642.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x36" value="KNOWLEDGE OF THE CODE" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=54;fontColor=#334155;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="423" width="823.8" height="73.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A1" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#15803d;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;A1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;CODE MAP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Scripts turn the repository into a graph of facts; no model is used.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#dff3e6;swimlaneFillColor=#dff3e6;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="516.5" width="1832" height="444.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A1-foot" value="Status: on one repository the typed store beat scripted search by 0.076 in answer recall; three storage engines gave identical answers; a widely used external graph tool scored lower (0.564 against 0.700). Open: which parser builds the facts." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="A1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="410" width="1780" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A1-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sources&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;What is read.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Repository files at one commit: code, tests, settings, documents&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Git history: which files changed together, and when&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="280" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A1-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fact extraction&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Scripts turn files into typed facts in about 5 seconds.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fact extractor: a script, no model&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Links hidden in strings: a web route and its client call, a queue and its handler&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Document reader: sections by heading, each with a content hash&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Conclusion ledger: claim, evidence and source, so it can be rechecked&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A1"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="280" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A1-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Graph&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Entities and the typed links between them.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Nodes: files, definitions, tests, tables, settings, migrations&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Edges: imports, calls, tests, cites, changed together&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Change sets: one node per commit joins its files&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Time on every fact: valid from one commit until another&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;A renamed or moved definition keeps its identity&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A1"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="280" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A1-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Typed store&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;All facts in one SQLite database, rebuilt for each working copy.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;One database of typed facts&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Re-extracted on change in seconds; nothing expires by age&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#15803d;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds A2 Model training · A3 Code queries&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A1"><mxGeometry x="1406" y="116" width="400" height="280" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A2" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#15803d;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;A2&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;GRAPH MODEL TRAINING&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Learn from past commits which files are related; runs on the GPU.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#dff3e6;swimlaneFillColor=#dff3e6;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="1045.3" width="2292" height="483.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A2-foot" value="Status: built and run once; in the one form tried, on one repository, the trained models added nothing. One form, not a verdict. Open: whether another form helps." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="A2"><mxGeometry x="26" y="449" width="2240" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A2-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Training set&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;The graph as it stood at each past commit.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Graph snapshots, one per past commit&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A2"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="319" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A2-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Training&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Hide a true link; learn to rank it above false ones.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Task: link prediction&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;On the GPU: an RTX 5070 with 12 GB, in containers, network off&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A2"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="319" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A2-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Models&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Five kinds, from tested to proposed.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#e11d48&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Graph embeddings (RotatE, ComplEx, TransE): each node becomes a vector of 256 numbers&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#e11d48&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Graph neural encoder (CompGCN): a node also mixes in its neighbours&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#e11d48&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Routed specialists: one small model per code area, and a router&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#94a3b8&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Text and code embeddings: search by meaning, not by word&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#94a3b8&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fine-tuned retriever: a small local model trained on our own lookups&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A2"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="319" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A2-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Evaluation rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Rules that prevent an overstated result.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Tune, freeze, then score once on unseen commits&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Placebo: a random scorer goes through the same steps&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Baselines: same folder, changed together, plain search&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A2"><mxGeometry x="1406" y="116" width="400" height="319" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A2-5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Link scores&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#e11d48&quot; style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;For a start file: how likely each other file is linked to it.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#15803d;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds A3 Code queries (Rank)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A2"><mxGeometry x="1866" y="116" width="400" height="319" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A3" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#15803d;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;A3&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;CODE QUERIES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;An agent sends a query and gets a few hundred tokens back instead of whole files.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#dff3e6;swimlaneFillColor=#dff3e6;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="1613" width="2752" height="400.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A3-foot" value="Status: in a replay the cache served 87.6 % of lookups with 0.0 % wrong answers. Not yet run: an agent using the layer while it works. Rejected after study: a graph database server, a graph written by a model, expiry by age." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="A3"><mxGeometry x="26" y="366" width="2700" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A3-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Query&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;The agent requests an answer when it needs one.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Example query: what does changing this file affect?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;On request only: one command; nothing added to every prompt&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Query types: a fixed list, each with its measured quality&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A3"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="236" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A3-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cache check&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;The same query on unchanged facts returns the stored answer.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Answer cache&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;An answer is dropped only if a fact it read has changed&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A3"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="236" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A3-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Search and traverse&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;From the start nodes, follow typed links a few hops.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Find the start nodes: by keyword or by path&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Traverse the graph within a link budget&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A3"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="236" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A3-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rank&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Three ranked lists merged into one.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Closeness: personalised PageRank from the start file&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Changed together: frequency, as a confidence&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#e11d48&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learned score: the link scores of the models&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fusion: reciprocal rank fusion, the sum of 1 / (60 + rank)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A3"><mxGeometry x="1406" y="116" width="400" height="236" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A3-5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Pack and return&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Return the top results that fit the token budget.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Pack to a budget of about 8,000 tokens&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Answer: a tool result of a few hundred tokens&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#1d4ed8;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds 3 WORK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A3"><mxGeometry x="1866" y="116" width="400" height="236" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="A3-6" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#0b4a24;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Uses&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Points in the work where agents use it.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #15803d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Session-start brief: a short map of the area&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#94a3b8&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Change list: the functions, callers, co-changed files and tests of a change&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#94a3b8&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Edit-time warning: a hook warns on a risky edit&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Evaluation: an agent with this tool against one with plain search&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#15803d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="A3"><mxGeometry x="2326" y="116" width="400" height="236" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x37" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#f3f4f6;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3494" y="2115.8" width="3352" height="1869.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x38" value="MEMORY" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=54;fontColor=#334155;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="2141.8" width="281.7" height="73.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B1" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#7c3aed;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;B1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;PROBLEM RECORDS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;The session that solves a hard problem records it, with a check that proves the cause.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#ebe3fc;swimlaneFillColor=#ebe3fc;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="2235.3" width="2292" height="352.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B1-foot" value="Status: designed, not built." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="B1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="318" width="2240" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B1-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Record&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot; style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Fixed fields: symptom, cause, fix, failed approaches.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="188" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B1-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cause check&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;The entry includes a check that detects the cause in the code.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Control pair: the check fires on the known-bad commit and stays quiet on the known-good one&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B1"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="188" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B1-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Write gate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Rejects entries that contain secrets or duplicate existing ones.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Removes secrets; refuses duplicates&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Missed-existing check: was this already stored but not found?&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B1"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="188" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B1-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Review&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;A reviewer who is not the author tries to refute it.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Reviewer: a strong model, never the author&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B1"><mxGeometry x="1406" y="116" width="400" height="188" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B1-5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Store&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Append-only files are the source of record; a search index is rebuilt from them.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Journal and index (SQLite)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#7c3aed;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds B2 Problem lookup&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B1"><mxGeometry x="1866" y="116" width="400" height="188" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B2" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#7c3aed;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;B2&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;PROBLEM LOOKUP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Search the stored problems before spending tokens on solving one.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#ebe3fc;swimlaneFillColor=#ebe3fc;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="2672" width="1832" height="358.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B2-foot" value="Status: designed, not built. Open: whether the library (B3) becomes this store or stays separate." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="B2"><mxGeometry x="26" y="324" width="1780" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B2-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Triggers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Points where repeated work costs most.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Before a stronger model, before a retry, before applying a suggested fix&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Lookup on a diff: warns when a change touches something an entry protects&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B2"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="194" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B2-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Match&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Find the stored entry for this error.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;The error text is reduced to a stable template and matched&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Result: lead, candidate or miss&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B2"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="194" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B2-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Verify gate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;The entry's own check runs on the current code. The fix is shown only if the cause is present.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Verify before use&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Do-not-apply entries: warnings that a likely fix is wrong here&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B2"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="194" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B2-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Invalidation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;An entry is rechecked when the code under it changes.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Marked suspect on change, then its check runs again&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#1d4ed8;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds 1 PLAN · 3 WORK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B2"><mxGeometry x="1406" y="116" width="400" height="194" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B3" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#7c3aed;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;B3&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;LIBRARY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;The project's record of decisions, measurements and mistakes.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#ebe3fc;swimlaneFillColor=#ebe3fc;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="3114.8" width="1832" height="358.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B3-foot" value="Status: built and in use." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="B3"><mxGeometry x="26" y="324" width="1780" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B3-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Record&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;A claim and how it is known: measured, quoted from a paper, reasoned, or the owner's ruling.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B3"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="194" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B3-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Journal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;One line per record. Lines are only added, never changed.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Correction: a new record replaces a wrong one; the top session decides&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B3"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="194" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B3-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Board&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;One page: what to look up before each kind of action, open tasks, known gaps.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B3"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="194" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B3-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lookup&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;By id or keyword. No match is reported as &amp;quot;not recorded&amp;quot;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Recall test: a new session answers questions from the library alone&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#1d4ed8;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds 1 PLAN (every session start)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B3"><mxGeometry x="1406" y="116" width="400" height="194" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B5" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#7c3aed;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;B5&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;STANDING NOTES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Text loaded into every session at start.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#ebe3fc;swimlaneFillColor=#ebe3fc;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="5448" y="3114.8" width="1372" height="358.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B5-foot" value="Status: built and in use." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="B5"><mxGeometry x="26" y="324" width="1320" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B5-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Instruction file&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;A short root file every session loads; details sit in files loaded only when needed.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Skills: packaged procedures, loaded only when a task needs them&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B5"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="194" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B5-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Information kept across hand-overs.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Memory index: one line per lasting note; a note is opened only when needed&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Notes file: written before a hand-over, read back after it&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B5"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="194" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B5-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Size&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Every call re-reads this text, so it is kept short.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Small standing context&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Prompt cache: add text at the end, not at the top&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#1d4ed8;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds 1 PLAN (every session start)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B5"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="194" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B4" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#7c3aed;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;B4&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;REASONING CACHE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;A cheaper model reuses solutions that a stronger model produced.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#ebe3fc;swimlaneFillColor=#ebe3fc;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="3557.5" width="1832" height="401.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B4-foot" value="Status: modelled only. Open: whether reuse beats escalation without a store; how partial solutions are combined." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="B4"><mxGeometry x="26" y="367" width="1780" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B4-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cheaper model first&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#94a3b8&quot; style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;A smaller model attempts the task, using a stored solution if one matches.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B4"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="237" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B4-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Escalation&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#94a3b8&quot; style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;On failure the task moves up: Haiku, Sonnet, Opus, Fable.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B4"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="237" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B4-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Store the solution&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;The stronger model's solution is stored for reuse.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#94a3b8&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Stored for reuse by cheaper models&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#94a3b8&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Combine partial solutions: parts of several stored solutions, joined through the graph&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B4"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="237" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="B4-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#3f1a8a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Measurement&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Whether reuse beats escalation without a store.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #7c3aed;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Reuse funnel: seven stages a reused answer passes through, each counted&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#94a3b8&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Tests before building: match rate with a perfect lookup, coverage of new work, share of work sent back&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#1d4ed8;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds 2 ADMIT (Model choice)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="B4"><mxGeometry x="1406" y="116" width="400" height="237" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
