<mxCell id="x40" value="EVALUATION" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=54;fontColor=#334155;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="4087.3" width="390.8" height="73.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="G" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#be185d;color:#ffffff;font-size:30px;border-radius:8px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;G&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:34px;color:#6d0f3a;&quot;&gt;MEASUREMENT AND RESEARCH&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:normal;color:#111827;margin-top:6px;&quot;&gt;Measurements and research are used to revise the harness rules.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;startSize=104;horizontal=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;collapsible=1;fillColor=#fbdcea;swimlaneFillColor=#fbdcea;strokeColor=#be185d;strokeWidth=3;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=26;spacingRight=26;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;fontSize=34;swimlaneLine=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3520" y="4180.8" width="2292" height="567.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="G-foot" value="Status: research round 3 had four lanes and 361 claims, each through a script gate and an independent refuter. Not done: the pilot, one real task run as a tree against a single session." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="G"><mxGeometry x="26" y="533" width="2240" height="26.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="G-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6d0f3a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Measure&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;All work is evaluated on the same seven measures.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #be185d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Seven measures: throughput, efficiency, token count, token cost, time taken, quality, hallucinations&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Token tally: every transcript counted, per session and per unit&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Machine recorder: memory, processor, the test queue&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#be185d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="G"><mxGeometry x="26" y="116" width="400" height="403" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="G-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6d0f3a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Research&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Collection and analysis before review.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #be185d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Questions fixed before any reading starts&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Collectors (cheaper models): facts and quotes, no judgment&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Analysts (stronger models): each claim with its source and what would disprove it&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#be185d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="G"><mxGeometry x="486" y="116" width="400" height="403" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="G-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6d0f3a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Review&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Independent review of every claim.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #be185d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Citation check: every quote exists where it is claimed&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Refuter sees only the claim and its evidence&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Three outcomes: verified, open risk, refuted; the top session decides&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#be185d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="G"><mxGeometry x="946" y="116" width="400" height="403" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="G-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6d0f3a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Design&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Start from an established design rather than a new one.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #be185d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Identify the classical problem and its standard solution first&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Seven designs adopted: master and workers, append-only storage, a trusted checker, systematic review, planted faults, B-trees, hazard analysis&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Model check: the rules run as a state machine with faults injected&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;External practice: 24 adopted and 54 to trial, of 861 ideas read&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Eight research lanes: tokens, graphs, learned encoders, memory and time, logic with learning, local models, orchestration, measurement&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;A single negative result does not rule out a method&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#be185d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="G"><mxGeometry x="1406" y="116" width="400" height="403" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="G-5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:24px;color:#6d0f3a;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Validation before rollout&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;Cheapest test first.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border:none;border-top:1px solid #be185d;opacity:0.4;margin:10px 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16a34a&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Replay of recorded sessions before live use, at no model cost&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;Dry run with stub agents to test the infrastructure&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;font-size:15px;color:#1f2937;padding-left:20px;text-indent:-20px;margin-bottom:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f59e0b&quot;&gt;&amp;#9679;&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;One live trial, with the scoring fixed beforehand, against a control&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.25;font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px;color:#7c3aed;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;feeds B3 Library · 1 PLAN (revised rules)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=6;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#be185d;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" parent="G"><mxGeometry x="1866" y="116" width="400" height="403" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
